{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t俄羅斯衛星通訊社報道，克里姆林宮發言人佩斯科夫表示，俄羅斯、中國、美國領導人的三方會晤，將於11月19日在深圳舉行，已就此達成一致。<br/>\n<br/>\n佩斯科夫說，俄羅斯總統普京、中國國家主席習近平、美國總統特朗普將於星期四，舉行三方會談，這次會晤將於深圳舉行的亞太經合組織峰會期間舉行。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：羅宇光\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T16:27:30.884461+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T15:57:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T18:02:12.121797+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T16:21:00.391413+00:00","content_hash":"2704d2ecc6e7447704b387635d376688542073f75a7ccf2e67090ea9f4f56c31","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}